{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22011","main_id":22011,"main_title":"众人祈祷中…","main_description":"鸣神大社的麻纪小姐似乎正为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"众人祈祷中…","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2201101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2201101,"sequence":2,"variant":0,"line_id":220110103,"next_line_ids":[220110104],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3107,"speaker_text_hash":3152133509,"speaker":"麻纪","speaker_raw":"麻纪","text_hash":363037346,"text":"是关于神社里求签的事。","raw_text":"是关于神社里求签的事。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2201101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22011","main_id":22011,"main_title":"众人祈祷中…","main_description":"鸣神大社的麻纪小姐似乎正为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"众人祈祷中…","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2201101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2201101,"sequence":3,"variant":0,"line_id":220110104,"next_line_ids":[220110105],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3107,"speaker_text_hash":3152133509,"speaker":"麻纪","speaker_raw":"麻纪","text_hash":2539051586,"text":"你知道「求签」是什么意思吧？简单来说，就是用抽签的方式进行的一种占卜。","raw_text":"你知道「求签」是什么意思吧？简单来说，就是用抽签的方式进行的一种占卜。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2201101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22011","main_id":22011,"main_title":"众人祈祷中…","main_description":"鸣神大社的麻纪小姐似乎正为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"众人祈祷中…","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2201101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2201101,"sequence":4,"variant":0,"line_id":220110105,"next_line_ids":[220110106],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3107,"speaker_text_hash":3152133509,"speaker":"麻纪","speaker_raw":"麻纪","text_hash":1397854850,"text":"根据抽到签上的签文，人们也能得知一些对于未来的简单预言。","raw_text":"根据抽到签上的签文，人们也能得知一些对于未来的简单预言。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2201101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22011","main_id":22011,"main_title":"众人祈祷中…","main_description":"鸣神大社的麻纪小姐似乎正为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"众人祈祷中…","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2201101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2201101,"sequence":5,"variant":0,"line_id":220110106,"next_line_ids":[220110107],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3107,"speaker_text_hash":3152133509,"speaker":"麻纪","speaker_raw":"麻纪","text_hash":3692888594,"text":"抽到了好签自然没问题，如果抽到不太好的签，人们一般就会把签留在神社这边，以此来祈祷化解可能到来的厄运。","raw_text":"抽到了好签自然没问题，如果抽到不太好的签，人们一般就会把签留在神社这边，以此来祈祷化解可能到来的厄运。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2201101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22011","main_id":22011,"main_title":"众人祈祷中…","main_description":"鸣神大社的麻纪小姐似乎正为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"众人祈祷中…","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2201101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2201101,"sequence":6,"variant":0,"line_id":220110107,"next_line_ids":[220110108],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3107,"speaker_text_hash":3152133509,"speaker":"麻纪","speaker_raw":"麻纪","text_hash":3941535370,"text":"但是…不知道到底是谁开始传一个谣言，说什么抽到坏签就快丢到树顶上，神灵会优先为你消灾驱祸之类的。","raw_text":"但是…不知道到底是谁开始传一个谣言，说什么抽到坏签就快丢到树顶上，神灵会优先为你消灾驱祸之类的。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2201101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22011","main_id":22011,"main_title":"众人祈祷中…","main_description":"鸣神大社的麻纪小姐似乎正为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"众人祈祷中…","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2201101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2201101,"sequence":7,"variant":0,"line_id":220110108,"next_line_ids":[220110109],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3107,"speaker_text_hash":3152133509,"speaker":"麻纪","speaker_raw":"麻纪","text_hash":3966553610,"text":"还说什么，丢得越高，好运就越快会实现，而厄运就越快被化解。真是无稽之谈！","raw_text":"还说什么，丢得越高，好运就越快会实现，而厄运就越快被化解。真是无稽之谈！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2201101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22011","main_id":22011,"main_title":"众人祈祷中…","main_description":"鸣神大社的麻纪小姐似乎正为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"众人祈祷中…","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2201101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2201101,"sequence":8,"variant":0,"line_id":220110109,"next_line_ids":[220110110],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3107,"speaker_text_hash":3152133509,"speaker":"麻纪","speaker_raw":"麻纪","text_hash":532980370,"text":"然后，这个谣言越传越离谱，现在不仅是抽到的签，还有人往树上丢摩拉！","raw_text":"然后，这个谣言越传越离谱，现在不仅是抽到的签，还有人往树上丢摩拉！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2201101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22011","main_id":22011,"main_title":"众人祈祷中…","main_description":"鸣神大社的麻纪小姐似乎正为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"众人祈祷中…","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2201101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2201101,"sequence":9,"variant":0,"line_id":220110110,"next_line_ids":[220110111,220110114],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3107,"speaker_text_hash":3152133509,"speaker":"麻纪","speaker_raw":"麻纪","text_hash":1507904258,"text":"还有模有样地说，只要丢上去的摩拉能停在树梢上，那就是神明接受了祈祷，不仅心中的愿望能实现，还能带来一整年的好运。","raw_text":"还有模有样地说，只要丢上去的摩拉能停在树梢上，那就是神明接受了祈祷，不仅心中的愿望能实现，还能带来一整年的好运。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2201101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22011","main_id":22011,"main_title":"众人祈祷中…","main_description":"鸣神大社的麻纪小姐似乎正为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"众人祈祷中…","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2201101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2201101,"sequence":10,"variant":0,"line_id":220110111,"next_line_ids":[220110112],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speaker_id":0,"speaker_text_hash":0,"speaker":"旅行者","speaker_raw":"旅行者","text_hash":898769898,"text":"真的有这种事吗？","raw_text":"真的有这种事吗？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2201101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22011","main_id":22011,"main_title":"众人祈祷中…","main_description":"鸣神大社的麻纪小姐似乎正为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"众人祈祷中…","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2201101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2201101,"sequence":11,"variant":0,"line_id":220110112,"next_line_ids":[220110113],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3107,"speaker_text_hash":3152133509,"speaker":"麻纪","speaker_raw":"麻纪","text_hash":2363725730,"text":"怎么可能！先不说到底神明能不能听到祈祷…但丢摩拉这种事也太离谱了，摩拉不都长得一样吗？","raw_text":"怎么可能！先不说到底神明能不能听到祈祷…但丢摩拉这种事也太离谱了，摩拉不都长得一样吗？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2201101.json"}
