{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22011","main_id":22011,"main_title":"众人祈祷中…","main_description":"鸣神大社的麻纪小姐似乎正为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"众人祈祷中…","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2201101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2201101,"sequence":13,"variant":0,"line_id":220110116,"next_line_ids":[220110117],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3107,"speaker_text_hash":3152133509,"speaker":"麻纪","speaker_raw":"麻纪","text_hash":2559224626,"text":"虽然我理解大家都想要祈福，但…但这么往上丢东西，压根就祈不了福啊。","raw_text":"虽然我理解大家都想要祈福，但…但这么往上丢东西，压根就祈不了福啊。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2201101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22011","main_id":22011,"main_title":"众人祈祷中…","main_description":"鸣神大社的麻纪小姐似乎正为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"众人祈祷中…","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2201101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2201101,"sequence":14,"variant":0,"line_id":220110117,"next_line_ids":[220110118],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3107,"speaker_text_hash":3152133509,"speaker":"麻纪","speaker_raw":"麻纪","text_hash":1750685642,"text":"而且，那些丢上去的签文和其他东西被风一吹，掉得到处都是。","raw_text":"而且，那些丢上去的签文和其他东西被风一吹，掉得到处都是。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2201101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22011","main_id":22011,"main_title":"众人祈祷中…","main_description":"鸣神大社的麻纪小姐似乎正为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"众人祈祷中…","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2201101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2201101,"sequence":15,"variant":0,"line_id":220110118,"next_line_ids":[220110119],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3107,"speaker_text_hash":3152133509,"speaker":"麻纪","speaker_raw":"麻纪","text_hash":604142194,"text":"我之前也试着自己去收拾过，但我实在不擅长运动，不仅东西没收拾干净，反而因为不知道怎么下来而折腾了好一阵…","raw_text":"我之前也试着自己去收拾过，但我实在不擅长运动，不仅东西没收拾干净，反而因为不知道怎么下来而折腾了好一阵…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2201101.json"}
